    "text": "Data Transfer > After connection ts established, bidirectional data transfer can take place. > The client and server can both send data and acknowledgments. > The acknowledgment is piggybacked with the data. > In example, client sends 2000 bytes of data in two segments. Server then sends 2000 bytes in one segment. > The client sends one more segment. > The first three segments carry both data and ack, but the last segment carries only an ack as there > are no more data to be sent.",
